,"official_note":"司徒是汉代三公之一，主管教化、民政等事务。在此段中，司徒刘恺对旧制提出异议，认为限制官员行三年丧不利于教化百姓和美化风俗，这体现了司徒在礼仪教化方面的职能，并推动了政策变革（丙戌日初听大臣行三年丧）。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"司徒劉愷以爲「非所以師表百姓，宣美風俗。」","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"74a74e89-1bb7-4a7b-af4a-f10d1708034f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":124,"link_td_description":"刘恺，字伯豫，东汉长安县（陕西省西安市）人，东汉大臣。","link_td_id":"Q10017064","link_td_number_id":4551824,"people_name":"劉愷","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘恺","people_xingming":"刘恺","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"95f535eb-db0e-11ef-baab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"12舊制：公卿、二千石、刺史不得行三年喪，司徒劉愷以爲「非所以師表百姓，宣美風俗。」丙戌，初聽大臣行三年喪。","content_fanyi":"旧制规定：三公、九卿、二千石官员和刺史，不得服三年之丧。司徒刘恺认为：“这不是给百姓作表率、宣扬美好风俗的做法。”丙戌日，开始允许大臣服三年之丧。","content_jianti_auto":"12旧制：公卿、二千石、刺史不得行三年丧，司徒刘恺以为「非所以师表百姓，宣美风俗。」丙戌，初听大臣行三年丧。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4092,"number":12,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"95f535e7-db0e-11ef-8d57-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"13癸卯，郡國九地震。","content_fanyi":"癸卯日，九个郡国发生地震。","content_jianti_auto":"13癸卯，郡国九地震。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4093,"number":13,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"95f535ec-db0e-11ef-ba3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRe